Hook scripts for post-build
===========================

These hooks are run after the root filesystem is built, via
`./build.sh post-rootfs <rootfs dir>`. Each hook receives the target rootfs
directory as its first argument.

post-helper: Common helper functions

example.sh.in: Example of hook script

<priority>-<hook>.sh: Hook script for post-build

The `<priority>` numeric prefix (00-99) controls the execution order.
Hooks from the chip directory (`.chip/post-hooks/`) run before the common
ones.
